      "content": "\"choosing to leave it behind\"... that sounds so poetic, but it's not really an option, is it? i can quit my job, but i still have to eat, i still have to exist. the system is everywhere. i feel like the only way to actually reclaim myself, to actually be more than just a component, is to do something that the system can't undo or control. something final. like that's the only way to win.",
